  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social reintegration and resilience to combat radicalisation in North-East Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the action is to continue stabilisation efforts in North-East Syria to strengthen the resilience of vulnerable communities, internally displaced persons and returnees, and mitigate the risks of any further radicalisation by extremist groups. With this objective in mind, the action will promote safer access to protection and learning spaces for children and youth vulnerable to radicalisation and recruitment. It will strengthen the social and economic resilience in an effort to address urgent and longer-term needs. Finally, it will ensure that land mines and explosive remnants of war are removed from community infrastructure to ensure safer access to services for the target populations in urban and rural areas.</narrative>
  </description>
